BRXCOMP                                                          MAINTC command

Use the BRXCOMP command to compile C programs that are part of the bREXX
runtime library.

The format of the BRXCOMP command is:
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------------+
| BRXCOMP  | c_fn [parm_fn|STDBRX [GCC options]]                              |
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------------+

Usage Notes:

1. Set up the proper minidisk search order with the BRXSRCH command before
   using this command.

2. The BRXCOMP produces an output TEXT file from the compilation on the A-disk.
